  "description_short": "Asian street food with a South African twist at The Market Off Main's vibrant food stall.",
  "description_long": "Bao Wow brings bold Asian street food flavours to Plettenberg Bay's popular Market Off Main. This vibrant food stall serves up soft, pillowy bao buns stuffed with creative fillings that blend traditional Asian ingredients with local South African touches. The casual market setting makes it perfect for a quick lunch or relaxed dinner while exploring the local food scene.\n\nTheir baos are the star of the show — think sticky pork belly, crispy chicken, or flavourful vegetarian options, all served with punchy pickles and house-made sauces. The atmosphere is lively and communal, with seating shared among the market's various food vendors. It's a great spot for groups wanting to sample different cuisines or families looking for something a bit different from the usual Garden Route offerings.\n\nLocated on Sewell Street, The Market Off Main is Plett's go-to destination for artisan food and craft beer. Bao Wow fits right in with the relaxed, creative vibe. Service is quick and friendly, prices are reasonable, and the quality consistently earns praise from locals and visitors alike.",
